WEBVTT

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:12.150
Hey, why don't you come in?
It will be nice having customers in this weather.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.270
Which way did she go?

00:00:14.270 --> 00:00:16.170
Hey, there she is!

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:17.620
Wait!

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.600
Where did she go?

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:25.520
She's just causing us trouble!

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:27.580
We have to find her and take her back!

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.630
The boss is looking too!

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.650
What's up?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:09.950
Stars cut through the skies

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:17.320
With fate in tow, they draw an arc.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:22.220
A power that sleeps amid an endless history

00:01:23.460 --> 00:01:29.460
Will be tested now.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.930
Time relentlessly turns everything into the past.

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:41.760
Just keep laughing it off... until you lose the ability to feel!

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:45.300
Kick all limitations aside

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:48.340
come now, take your stand!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:52.920
Draw your honed blade, abandon all hesitation...

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:56.670
and let your life burn bright!

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:29.440
The Ravine of Bloody Clouds

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:27.690
While Oriku was expanding his Chikyou sect,

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:34.380
Shushin, the crown prince of the Great Ming Empire
had returned to his parents along with Ochu.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:38.450
Government of the Great Ming Empire

00:02:34.810 --> 00:02:38.670
While helping his father, the emperor,

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:42.480
with various executive tasks, he travelled
around regions referenced in the trial's manual.

00:02:42.480 --> 00:02:45.970
He was engaged in the Guhai region's mundane affairs.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:48.010
So you came with the <i>Kenrou</i>.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:52.640
Taking advantage of <i>Kenrou</i> without knowing what they originally are...

00:02:52.640 --> 00:02:55.530
It's indeed something a heretic sect would do.

00:02:56.320 --> 00:02:57.690
Continue...

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:00.560
I escaped to the nearby mountains.

00:03:00.560 --> 00:03:03.530
I hid there for about a week.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:05.950
But I was found and taken back.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:11.110
Mom and dad even said "We know you can do it!".

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.160
And then you were taken away.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:13.910
Yes...

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.600
After that, it happened as you already told us, right?

00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:18.550
Yes.

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.760
After that she ran away.

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:27.060
But then she was caught by a slave dealer
and sold at the red light district.

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:29.430
It's a horrible story...

00:03:29.430 --> 00:03:32.650
The parents believed if they gave her away as a <i>kenrou</i>

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:35.370
that they would be able to become enlightened.

00:03:35.370 --> 00:03:41.570
<i>Kenrou</i> is the name of a female enlightened that is taken as a sexual partner by a male enlightened so that he can increase his power.

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:45.140
It's pointless to take on a normal girl...

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:53.060
Ravine of Blood Clouds

00:03:47.510 --> 00:03:49.410
Ravine of Blood Clouds.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:53.640
A valley of death located by the boarder of the Great Ming Empire.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:58.090
It used to be called the Magical Stones Valley and it was very prosperous.

00:03:58.650 --> 00:04:02.270
However, with the amount of mined materials starting to decreasing

00:04:02.270 --> 00:04:05.910
and the cost of transportation taking its toll, it slowly fell out of use.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.200
Regardless, there were still some magic veins that did not deplete.

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:13.720
So they could still pride themselves on being
the sixth largest mining site in the Ming Empire.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:18.920
Even if you are coming on behalf of the government, that is something I just can't allow.

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:21.860
We will have to keep hold of your horses.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:26.160
These stables house horses used for
carrying magical stones from the valley.

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:28.140
Everyone here is used to handling them.

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:29.880
If anyone eats them, I won't forgive you...

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.290
No, no one would do that...

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.070
Why are we going into the valley?

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.500
First we'll let the soldiers rest.

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:42.630
Apparently there's an inn there where miners used to stay.

00:04:42.630 --> 00:04:44.620
Who are those people?

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.640
Looks like they're with the government.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:58.030
Ahh, <i>gochisousama</i>!

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.410
You guys aren't from around here, are you?

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:01.830
Where did you guys come from?

00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.670
We're from here and there.

00:05:04.670 --> 00:05:05.570
Huh?

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:09.280
So, it's been quite awhile...

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.100
Is there anywhere you could point us to for some girl action?

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:15.430
Hmph, no, I don't think I can...

00:05:15.430 --> 00:05:17.170
If you've finished eating, please leave.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:18.640
There are customers waiting.

00:05:18.640 --> 00:05:19.920
So he says.

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.160
Lately, the east mine's magical stone output isn't very good.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:26.670
I wonder if that mine's done for.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:30.350
I heard you guys are here because of some government job.

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:31.690
How did you know?

00:05:31.690 --> 00:05:33.610
Everyone knows.

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:36.760
They're all gossiping that some fishy people came.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:39.670
I see... I guess they really don't like us.

00:05:41.210 --> 00:05:41.990
Hmm?

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:43.030
Wha...

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:45.190
It's ok, it's ok.

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:48.360
By the way, I wanted to ask you about the rumors

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.050
regarding the Blood Clouds heretic sect that's based in this valley.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:54.440
Could you tell us anything you know?

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:59.370
There used to be rumors that there were some scary
enlightened people here, like you said.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:01.400
But no one's ever seen them.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.450
I wonder about that...

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:05.400
If you don't believe me then ask other people.

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:08.220
Oh, and I'm keeping this as a physical contact fee.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:10.220
Hey, wait a minute!

00:06:11.160 --> 00:06:13.450
It's all grannies, isn't it?

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.650
True, you really don't see any young girls around.

00:06:18.200 --> 00:06:20.740
Could you please spare us a few minutes?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.000
It doesn't look like we have a choice...

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.570
It won't take long.

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.630
Kenrei-<i>dono</i> just wants to have a little chat.

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:30.650
<i>Kenrei</i>?

00:06:33.270 --> 00:06:36.720
Why are you in such a remote region, Kenrei-<i>dono</i>?

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:39.810
In recent years, the amount of magical stones mined has decreased.

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:43.590
With that being said, it is still an
important surveillance region of this prefecture.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.650
I come here around twice a month.

00:06:45.650 --> 00:06:46.860
However...

00:06:47.530 --> 00:06:51.430
Even if it's your job,
we can't just have you doing whatever you want.

00:06:51.720 --> 00:06:55.010
After all, we've been put in charge of running this place.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:58.030
So you at least have to talk to us first.

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.680
Also, regarding the Blood Clouds Sect...

00:07:00.680 --> 00:07:02.940
We've already spoken to <i>Houmyoufu</i>.

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:05.770
Is there need for us to wait for that?

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:08.350
A sect that asks people to sell their daughters' body

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:10.150
in exchange for enlightenment can't possibly be legal!

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.230
That is a problem between the individuals and the Sect.

00:07:13.230 --> 00:07:16.240
To be neutral to civil affairs is the basic principal
of the administration of justice.

00:07:17.040 --> 00:07:22.150
Plus, they have twelve very talented enlightened on their side.

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.520
We can't just take them on.

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:25.670
Twelve?

00:07:26.030 --> 00:07:28.320
He's talking about the Twelve Wicked of the Blood Clouds.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:35.930
They're all either at the top end of the chikuki or kyotan level.
They're all very strong enlightened.

00:07:36.410 --> 00:07:41.690
However, they've hit a wall and so they've reduced themselves to outlaws.

00:07:43.290 --> 00:07:45.480
Please understand.

00:07:46.450 --> 00:07:47.770
It's fine.

00:07:47.770 --> 00:07:51.720
According to the reply from the <i>Houmyofu</i>,
they will be sending strong enlightened soon.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:53.290
We're also enlightened!

00:07:53.290 --> 00:07:55.080
Our opponents are <i>kyotan</i>, you know.

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:57.120
Let's just leave it to them and head back.

00:08:00.810 --> 00:08:03.830
Please, save my mom and dad!

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.790
I don't know what they'll do once they find out I ran away.

00:08:07.790 --> 00:08:09.710
And the same goes for the other girls.

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:13.220
Don't worry, I'll definitely save them.

00:08:13.590 --> 00:08:20.070
If I go back now, they'll think that I'm just all talk.

00:08:20.070 --> 00:08:22.640
I have a message from Kenrei-<i>sama</i>.

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:27.730
What is it?

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.030
Is this...?

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.170
Is it the location of the sect's hideout.

00:08:32.170 --> 00:08:35.150
Maybe he's like, "If you think can pull it off then go for it".

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:36.240
Let's do it!

00:08:39.630 --> 00:08:42.290
So that's their main shrine...

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:44.880
Please scout out for me.

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.510
We're making a map of the area.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.880
Yes sir!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.610
The opponents are very strong.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.370
Please don't be reckless.

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:54.090
We understand.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:58.300
Me and Ochu will go take a look at the girl's house.

00:08:58.300 --> 00:08:59.170
Understood!

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:08.940
We've already walked quite a bit.

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.520
Is that map accurate?

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:12.930
She drew it herself.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.900
It has to be accurate.

00:09:15.460 --> 00:09:16.490
It's that one!

00:09:16.490 --> 00:09:18.690
The only one on that side, that one!

00:09:26.970 --> 00:09:28.910
How could they do such a horrible thing...

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:30.830
Shushin!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:37.220
What happened at that house!?

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:38.440
I don't know!

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:40.070
Don't mess with me!

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.660
The Blood Clouds Sect did that, didn't they!?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.030
I don't know!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:49.460
You can't just show up and accuse people!

00:09:55.540 --> 00:09:57.390
Don't underestimate an enlightened.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.060
Shushin!

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:01.940
I'll ask you one last time.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:03.830
The Blood Clouds Sect did that, didn't they?

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:10.110
We can't have you bullying our common folk, now, can we?

00:10:12.150 --> 00:10:13.490
You!

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:23.640
Go look in that house.

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:25.320
A whole family has been murdered there.

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.510
I see...

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.340
What do you mean, "I see..."?

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.440
People have been killed...

00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:33.590
That's why we came here to clean it up.

00:10:33.590 --> 00:10:34.530
What?

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.990
This valley has it's own rules.

00:10:39.170 --> 00:10:43.130
This is a poor remote village with nothing.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:46.470
But ever since the magical stones were discovered,

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:50.100
ruffians from all over the country started rushing in.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:54.250
And what could we do against those people?

00:10:55.560 --> 00:10:58.830
In order to keep this valley safe,

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:03.430
I had to ask for the help of the enlightened that live at the edge of the valley.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:09.950
This valley has been safe so far precisely because of the Blood Clouds Sect.

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:13.060
And for that you hand them young girls?!

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:19.770
If that helps them become stronger then it's something unavoidable.

00:11:23.700 --> 00:11:28.080
Did those people get killed because their daughter ran away?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:29.800
It's the law.

00:11:29.800 --> 00:11:32.830
If we make an exception then it will just happen again.

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.590
And yet again.

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:39.920
I'm here listening to you but all I hear is your 'grown-up' excuses one after the other.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.250
Shushin!

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:43.040
Don't provoke them!

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.750
All of you, listen up!

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:49.310
The one you have in front of you is not just a simple government official.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.600
Don't!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:53.370
My name is Shushin!

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:57.110
The son of Shuzeto, Emperor of the Great Ming Empire.

00:11:57.110 --> 00:11:58.820
I'm the crown prince!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.060
What?

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:02.010
The crown prince of the Great Ming Empire?

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:03.450
Why is he here?

00:12:03.450 --> 00:12:07.390
I've witnessed your evil actions with my own two eyes.

00:12:07.390 --> 00:12:11.830
I'll report on your wrong doings and
make sure you are punished accordingly.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.840
Kenrei, prepare yourself!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:17.570
Now that I, the prince, have seen this disastrous scene,

00:12:17.570 --> 00:12:20.210
there won't be anywhere for a petty official like you to run.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:25.220
Compared to my empire, your little existence is nothing!

00:12:25.640 --> 00:12:29.530
I'll beat that fact into you until you see your bones.

00:12:34.040 --> 00:12:37.280
As I'd expect from the crown prince.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:39.920
Babbling all high and mighty.

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:42.360
Shut up already, kid!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.650
Are you mad, Kenrei?

00:12:46.650 --> 00:12:49.820
You see, your highness.

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:56.290
Even if we're in the Great Ming Empire,
your reasoning doesn't work the same here.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.320
Please <i>Sensei</i>, show these kids what it's like to be on their knees.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.420
Who do you think you are?

00:13:04.420 --> 00:13:05.650
Shushin...

00:13:07.880 --> 00:13:09.080
Shushin!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.390
We can even easily do stuff like this.

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:16.650
It didn't even cross your mind that something
like this could happen, did it, your highness?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:18.530
You're an enlightened, aren't you.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:20.590
I can sense a small amount of <i>reiki</i> from you.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.700
Don't tell me this guy is one of the
Twelve Wicked of the Blood Clouds.

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.290
What about you, kid?

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.170
Are you too scared to make a move?

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:32.420
Or do you just have better judgment?

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:36.120
Shall I just torment this one then?

00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:43.880
Shushin!

00:13:53.570 --> 00:13:56.760
Everyone in this world is equal.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:59.040
It doesn't matter if you're a prince or not.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:03.150
If you separate the head from the body...

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.590
anyone's finished.

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:18.810
Are you alright, Ochu?

00:14:18.810 --> 00:14:19.990
Yeah...

00:14:19.990 --> 00:14:23.590
It looks like my head is still connected to my body...

00:14:27.270 --> 00:14:28.530
What's wrong?

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:29.570
Ouch!

00:14:29.570 --> 00:14:32.340
Careful... the roof's low.

00:14:32.340 --> 00:14:34.510
I know, I already hit it...

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:37.920
Now that you say that,
I feel like I hit something before.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:41.750
This is...

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:47.280
What an atrocity...

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.320
Come on, it's at the end of this corridor.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:52.490
Hey, do you really have pretty clothes?

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:54.790
Yeah, so hurry up and walk already.

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:59.000
And I get to choose the colour too, right?

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:01.080
Yeah, of course...

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:01.580
Huh?

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:03.330
It smells kind of funny here, doesn't it?

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:05.130
Walk already!

00:15:05.130 --> 00:15:08.450
I wonder who that is.
I feel like I've heard that voice before.

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:09.560
Me too...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:13.300
Hey, hurry up!

00:15:13.670 --> 00:15:15.910
Tonight's a blood feast.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:18.990
You girls will be serving the enlightened-<i>sama</i>.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.770
Well then, I wonder what feast we'll be shown tonight.

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:29.740
I'm fed up of watching the <i>Kenro</i>'s dance.

00:15:29.740 --> 00:15:32.280
I'd like to see something new.

00:15:32.770 --> 00:15:35.730
Thanks to Kenrei-<i>dono</i>'s help,

00:15:35.730 --> 00:15:40.320
we were able to capture an idiot who claimed to be the crown prince.

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:41.670
I'm the real deal!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:46.750
Ah, and...?

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:50.480
These two have actually got some training.

00:15:50.480 --> 00:15:53.300
I think it might be worth retraining them as slaves.

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:57.960
It's true that youngsters with natural power are valuable, but...

00:15:57.960 --> 00:16:02.960
Those two were looking into the Blood Clouds Sect, weren't they?

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:06.190
Wouldn't it be best to get rid of them?

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:09.820
Do they really have the qualities to be slaves?

00:16:09.820 --> 00:16:13.350
We'll have to find out about that.

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:14.470
Loosen it up.

00:16:22.680 --> 00:16:26.840
Think about what it is that you need to do to survive.

00:16:33.210 --> 00:16:36.260
To think that I'd be able to see the crown prince,

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:39.720
who talked down to me so pompously, lick someone's boot.

00:16:39.720 --> 00:16:41.100
This is great!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:46.480
It's your life, do with it as you please.

00:16:49.310 --> 00:16:55.110
What's wrong, your highness?
Hurry up and show me your lame side!

00:16:56.240 --> 00:17:00.120
Come on, take your cute tongue out!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:03.970
Lick the enlightened-<i>sama</i>'s shoes.

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:08.000
That's what the initiation to slavery is.

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:12.260
I'm the crown prince!
I can't do such a thing!

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.320
It looks like your friend here is smart.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:39.290
He knows when to give up his self-respect.

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:41.700
You should learn from him.

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:43.920
But I guess it's too late now.

00:17:43.920 --> 00:17:44.930
Stand up.

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.190
Uncuff him.

00:17:49.190 --> 00:17:50.180
Come here!

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.300
You're gonna die along with your self-respect.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:07.500
Kenrei-<i>dono</i> believes that everyone is equal.

00:18:10.410 --> 00:18:14.010
Exactly, everyone's equal!

00:18:14.010 --> 00:18:15.820
Tonight's a good night, isn't it?

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:17.760
Now, take it.

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:26.290
What are you thinking about?

00:18:27.490 --> 00:18:32.370
I gave you that axe, so do whatever you like with it.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.590
You can even attack me with it.

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.090
Hurry up!

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:42.610
Kenrei-<i>dono</i> is becoming inpatient.

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:50.060
You've got to be kidding me, Och...

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:56.400
Ochu! Are you really planning on...?

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:06.250
Stop...

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.810
Stop!

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:10.430
Please don't!

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:13.390
I beg you! Please don't do this!

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:14.900
Hey, shut up already!

00:19:19.400 --> 00:19:22.240
I beg you, please don't kill me!

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:23.260
Shut up!

00:19:27.090 --> 00:19:28.890
Did you drop something?

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:33.720
You picked up your life just a while ago.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.900
You should treat it with care.

00:19:44.870 --> 00:19:48.490
If you understand your fate, then follow it.

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.960
Please, don't kill me!

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.230
Please make me your slave!

00:20:05.170 --> 00:20:06.780
I beg you!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:13.890
Oh, prince-<i>kun</i> can actually beg.

00:20:13.890 --> 00:20:17.440
But it looks like you're a bit late to repent.

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:33.880
Ah, didn't I tell you I don't want it?!

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:35.290
Hey, wait a minute!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:37.530
Ah! You touched my breasts!

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:39.270
I didn't, don't!

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:42.340
What?!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:46.810
Now I'm angry!
They said they would show me some pretty clothes.

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:50.720
They even said I could choose my own colour!!

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:51.880
Huh?

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:52.990
Who are you?!

00:20:56.580 --> 00:20:58.980
Ruri, why are you here?!

00:20:59.690 --> 00:21:02.120
Who cares, just kill her!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.410
What the...

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:23.730
That's the Unstoppable Fire Sword Technique.

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:26.670
No way! That girl can defeat a <i>renki</i>?!

00:21:59.960 --> 00:22:06.330
They said... they said they'd let me wear pretty clothes!

00:22:06.330 --> 00:22:09.670
They said I could!

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:13.910
That I could!

00:22:31.030 --> 00:22:36.390
A wind blowing through this valley

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:42.820
Carries a new season along with it.

00:22:43.640 --> 00:22:49.340
Amid days that seemed stuck on repeat,

00:22:49.720 --> 00:22:55.140
I found a piece of happiness.

00:22:56.100 --> 00:23:02.240
Twinkling days that were spent chasing a dream

00:23:02.430 --> 00:23:08.730
Disappeared into the past, leaving memories behind.

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:14.860
But my dreams turn this unyielding passion

00:23:15.020 --> 00:23:21.950
Into a newfound strength.

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:50.030
Next time

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:50.030
Reunion
